                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is way to early to put a game into early access. There is no tutorial on how to play this game.  The game description says something about looting and farming - but there are just boxes which contain the same stuff over and over. There is no progress in this game. And the whole game only has like 3 different sounds. No walking / step sounds. No environment sounds. No zombie scream sounds (only a single zombie-attack sound).\n\nThere is nothing to achieve, nothing to grind or farm for. \nOnly good things are the graphics - compared to all the other stuff they are quite good.",
